  "title": "Rose Petal Pound Cake",
  "description": "Two flavors are swirled together in this rich pound cake: an almond batter and a pink-tinted rosewater-scented batter. It&#39;s dusted with confectioners&#39; sugar before serving.",
  "authors": [
